"Profile: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entity: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Profiili: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entiteetti: <strong>%s</strong> "
"(ID: %d)"

